---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { CONTACT } from '../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Accessibility', url: '/accessibility/' }];
---

<Page
  title="Accessibility — John Bald Funeral Directors"
  heading="Accessibility"
  description="How we have built this website to be usable by everyone, and how to tell us if something is not working for you."
  standfirst="People reach this site tired, distressed, and often on a poor connection. It has been built with that in mind."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <h2>What we have done</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Large, high-contrast text.</strong> Body text is set larger than most
      websites use, and colours are chosen to meet the strictest contrast standard for
      readable text.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Nothing moves.</strong> No carousels, no animations, no pop-ups, no chat
      windows appearing over what you are reading.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Keyboard usable throughout.</strong> Every link, button and form field can
      be reached and operated without a mouse, with a visible focus outline.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Works with screen readers.</strong> Proper headings, real landmarks,
      descriptive links, and labelled form fields.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fast on a poor connection.</strong> The site is built as plain pages with
      almost no JavaScript, so it loads on rural mobile signal.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>You can zoom.</strong> Text resizes up to 200% without anything breaking or
      overlapping.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>The telephone number is always visible</strong> on a phone, without
      scrolling.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Standards</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines version 2.2 at level AA
    throughout, and level AAA for text contrast.
  </p>

  <h2>If something does not work</h2>
  <p>
    Please tell us, and please do not assume it is your fault or not worth mentioning. If
    you cannot use part of this website, that is a fault we want to fix.
  </p>
  <p>
    Telephone <a href={CONTACT.phoneHref} class="font-semibold">{CONTACT.phone}</a> or
    email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>You never have to use this website</h2>
  <p>
    Everything here can be done by telephone or by coming in. If reading a screen is
    difficult for any reason, telephone us and we will go through whatever you need. We
    can also post you printed copies of our price list or any of our guides.
  </p>
</Page>
